- * topaz: run the Gold cluster at its top frequency. SM6225 cpufreq-hw
- * (qcom,cpufreq-hw, freq-domain1 at 0xf523000; msm-4.19 qcom-cpufreq-hw.c
- * layout): LUT at +0x110, 32-byte rows, PERF_STATE at +0x920.
- * Nothing scales it down again: there is no XNU cpufreq driver yet.
+ * kunzite (SM6475 parrot): both cpufreq-epss domains (0: A55, 1: A78) from
+ * the live FDT. Same EPSS IP as topaz's SM6225 (LUT +0x110, 32-byte rows).
+ * READ-ONLY for now: the PERF_STATE (+0x920) write offset is not yet
+ * verified against a parrot kernel source (topaz's RCG lesson), so print
+ * the LUTs and change nothing until then.
  */
 #if defined(ARM64_BOARD_CONFIG_SWEET)
 #include <sys/param.h>
@@ -12,7 +13,8 @@
